{"version":1,"content":"<p>天王郭富城同太太方媛婚後育有3名囡囡，最近郭富城被發現於大坑道嘉園（「城堡」）嘅安樂窩天台悄悄將昔日嘅金剛陣撤走，換上全新「三獅守護」布局，即傳出佢力求望三年內打破「四大天王外父命」都市傳說，追仔成功再做爸爸。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T05:22:20.142474+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T05:01:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:20.833334+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T05:18:20.833334+00:00","content_hash":"ba02acb1a908c858afab576c570f140637f5fa0e14de133196c3bd65858be26c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}